      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "下班前我们把明天的事情准备一下吧。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好。明天上午先开会，对吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "对，九点半开始。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我需要带哪些资料？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "今天的结果和上周的记录都带上。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "还需要准备问题吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "最好写两三个你想确认的问题。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我现在就记下来，免得明天忘了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "很好。还有，明天可能会比平时早一点儿忙。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我提前十分钟到。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "不用太早，时间够。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我主要是不想早上太着急。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "那提前一点儿确实更适合你。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "资料我放在桌子左边，明天一来就能看到。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "好习惯。我也把会议需要的东西准备好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这样明天早上会轻松很多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "对，今天多准备五分钟，明天能省不少时间。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc009_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "准备好了，我们可以下班了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
